OL,3,ATwelve killed in attack on airport in
OL,4,ASaudi capital Riyadh
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 12 people have been killed and
OL,7,F309 injured in an attack on an airport
OL,8,Fin the Saudi capital Riyadh, local
OL,9,Fauthorities say.
OL,11,FThe deaths included four Saudis, two
OL,12,Fpeople from Bangladesh and one person
OL,13,Feach from the US, Jordan, Palestine,
OL,14,FSyria, Sudan and Egypt, the Saudi civil
OL,15,Faviation authority said. Operations at
OL,16,FKing Khalid International Airport have
OL,17,Fbeen suspended.
OL,19,FA Saudi-led military coalition has
OL,20,Fvowed to respond to the attack, which
OL,21,Fit has blamed on the Houthis and called
OL,22,Fa "war crime".
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
